::Python Flow Control Statements::
Which is the correct syntax for an if-else statement in Python?
{
~if-else():
~if-else{}
=if-else:
~if-else[]
}

::Python Flow Control Statements::
What is the purpose of an if-elif-else statement?
{
~To execute specific code if a condition is true or false.
=To check multiple conditions and execute different code blocks based on the first true condition.
~To define loops in a program.
~None of the above.
}

::Python Flow Control Statements::
What is the purpose of the elif keyword in Python?
{
~It is used to execute a block of code regardless of the condition.
~It is used to terminate the program.
=It stands for "else if" and is used to check another condition if the previous one is false.
~It is used to define a nested if statement.
}
